# caster tape - records to a .cast via asciinema
Output disconnected_interpreter_demo.cast
Set TypingSpeed 0

Type "uv run consortium.py client"
Enter
Sleep 12

Type@0.1 connect
Sleep 3
Enter
Sleep 2

Type@0.1 list
Enter
Sleep 2

Type@0.1 interact
Space
Tab
Sleep 0.5
Enter
Sleep 2

Type@0.1 info
Enter
Sleep 2

Type@0.1 exit
Enter
